{"title":"Career Roadmap · Buyer","role":"Buyer","summary":"A Buyer is responsible for selecting and purchasing products that a retail business sells to customers. The role combines consumer understanding, product selection, supplier management, negotiation, pricing, inventory planning, and sales analysis.","facts":{"Current degree":"BBA / BMS / BBM (Bachelor of Business Administration / Management Studies)","Course":"BBA – Retail Management"},"about":[{"label":"Important","text":"In retail, Buyer is usually not a first-day graduate role. Graduates commonly enter as Buying Assistant, Junior Buyer, Buying Executive, or Merchandise Executive and progress after gaining category and supplier experience."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus","What changes"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2028"},{"text":"Retail foundations"},{"text":"Retail, consumer behaviour, merchandising, Excel"}],[{"text":"2028–2030"},{"text":"Buying support"},{"text":"Product selection, supplier coordination, purchase orders"}],[{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"Category ownership"},{"text":"Sales, margins, inventory and supplier negotiations"}],[{"text":"2033–2036"},{"text":"Senior buying"},{"text":"Category strategy, forecasting, assortment planning"}],[{"text":"2036–2040"},{"text":"Buying leadership"},{"text":"Multiple categories, budgets and supplier portfolios"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Commercial leadership"},{"text":"Head of Buying, Category Director, Commercial Director"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build this","Key skills","Proof"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Retail fundamentals"},{"text":"Marketing, accounting, consumer behaviour, Excel"},{"text":"Retail analysis"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Merchandising & buying"},{"text":"Assortment, sourcing, pricing, inventory"},{"text":"Buying internship"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Commercial analytics"},{"text":"Forecasting, margins, SQL, Power BI"},{"text":"Category-analysis project"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Supplier & category management"},{"text":"Negotiation, buying plans, budgeting"},{"text":"Retail buying internship"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Build Retail Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Retail Management"},{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Consumer Behaviour"},{"text":"Business Economics"},{"text":"Financial Accounting"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Business Communication"},{"text":"Supply Chain Fundamentals"},{"text":"Entrepreneurship"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Understand the retail ecosystem"},{"type":"h","text":"Supplier"},{"type":"h","text":"Manufacturer / Brand"},{"type":"h","text":"Buyer"},{"type":"h","text":"Warehouse / Distribution Centre"},{"type":"h","text":"Store / E-commerce"},{"type":"h","text":"Customer"},{"type":"p","text":"The Buyer sits at the intersection of supplier relationships and customer demand."},{"type":"h","text":"Core Retail Concepts"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SKU"},{"text":"Category"},{"text":"Assortment"},{"text":"Product mix"},{"text":"Stock keeping"},{"text":"Inventory turnover"},{"text":"Sell-through"},{"text":"Markdowns"},{"text":"Gross margin"},{"text":"Gross margin return on investment"},{"text":"Stock cover"},{"text":"Reorder point"},{"text":"Lead time"},{"text":"MOQ"},{"text":"Purchase order"},{"text":"Vendor"},{"text":"Private label"},{"text":"Seasonal merchandise"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Excel Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Become strong in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"SUMIFS"},{"text":"COUNTIFS"},{"text":"IF/IFS"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"},{"text":"Pivot Tables"},{"text":"Charts"},{"text":"Conditional formatting"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Power Query"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Excel is one of the most important tools for entry-level buying and merchandising work."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Learn Buying & Merchandising"},{"type":"p","text":"Now focus on how retailers decide what to buy, how much to buy and when to buy it."},{"type":"h","text":"Product selection"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to evaluate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer demand"},{"text":"Product trends"},{"text":"Historical sales"},{"text":"Price points"},{"text":"Competitor products"},{"text":"Product quality"},{"text":"Supplier capability"},{"text":"Expected margin"},{"text":"Seasonality"},{"text":"Inventory risk"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Assortment planning"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Category"},{"type":"flow","items":["Sub-category","Brand","Product","SKU"]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"h","text":"Footwear"},{"type":"flow","items":["Sports Shoes","Running Shoes","Men's Running Shoes","Individual size/colour SKUs"]},{"type":"h","text":"Supplier Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Supplier identification"},{"text":"Vendor evaluation"},{"text":"RFQ/RFP concepts"},{"text":"Product sampling"},{"text":"Cost negotiation"},{"text":"MOQ negotiation"},{"text":"Lead times"},{"text":"Quality standards"},{"text":"Payment terms"},{"text":"Delivery performance"},{"text":"Vendor scorecards"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Negotiation variables"},{"type":"p","text":"A buyer may negotiate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Unit cost"},{"text":"Quantity"},{"text":"Delivery date"},{"text":"Payment terms"},{"text":"MOQ"},{"text":"Returns"},{"text":"Quality requirements"},{"text":"Promotional support"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Build Commercial Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"A modern buyer needs to understand numbers, not just products."},{"type":"h","text":"Important metrics"},{"type":"h","text":"Sell-through"},{"type":"h","text":"Units sold ÷ Units received × 100"},{"type":"h","text":"Gross margin"},{"type":"h","text":"Sales – Cost of Goods Sold"},{"type":"h","text":"Gross margin %"},{"type":"h","text":"Gross Margin ÷ Sales × 100"},{"type":"h","text":"Inventory turnover"},{"type":"p","text":"Measures how efficiently inventory is being sold and replenished."},{"type":"h","text":"Stock cover"},{"type":"p","text":"Estimates how long current inventory can support expected demand."},{"type":"h","text":"Markdown"},{"type":"p","text":"Reduction in selling price to accelerate inventory movement."},{"type":"h","text":"Forecasting"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Historical demand analysis"},{"text":"Seasonality"},{"text":"Trend analysis"},{"text":"Moving averages"},{"text":"Basic forecasting"},{"text":"Promotional impact"},{"text":"New-product forecasting"},{"text":"Demand variability"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A buyer must balance:"},{"type":"h","text":"Too little stock → Lost sales"},{"type":"h","text":"Too much stock → Excess inventory + markdowns"},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics Tools"},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Category sales dashboard"},{"text":"Supplier dashboard"},{"text":"Inventory dashboard"},{"text":"Margin dashboard"},{"text":"SKU performance dashboard"}]},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"p","text":"SELECT"},{"type":"p","text":"WHERE"},{"type":"p","text":"GROUP BY"},{"type":"p","text":"JOIN"},{"type":"p","text":"CASE"},{"type":"p","text":"CTE"},{"type":"p","text":"Window Functions"},{"type":"p","text":"SQL becomes especially useful in large retailers and e-commerce organisations."},{"type":"h","text":"Python"},{"type":"p","text":"Optional but useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Demand forecasting"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Pricing analysis"},{"text":"Inventory analysis"},{"text":"Automation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Become Commercially Job-Ready"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Category planning"},{"text":"Buying budgets"},{"text":"Open-to-buy planning"},{"text":"Vendor negotiations"},{"text":"Purchase planning"},{"text":"Seasonal assortment planning"},{"text":"Pricing"},{"text":"Promotions"},{"text":"Inventory optimisation"},{"text":"Competitor analysis"},{"text":"Supplier performance management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Open-to-Buy"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the principle:"},{"type":"p","text":"How much additional inventory can the retailer purchase while staying within its sales, inventory and cash-flow plan?"},{"type":"p","text":"This is an important commercial buying concept."}]},{"heading":"Specialisation Options","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Key skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Fashion Buyer"},{"text":"Trends, apparel, fabrics, seasonal collections"}],[{"text":"Beauty Buyer"},{"text":"Cosmetics, brands, product trends"}],[{"text":"Grocery Buyer"},{"text":"FMCG, perishables, replenishment"}],[{"text":"Electronics Buyer"},{"text":"Product specifications, technology trends"}],[{"text":"Home & Furniture Buyer"},{"text":"Product assortment, sourcing"}],[{"text":"Sports Buyer"},{"text":"Sports categories and consumer trends"}],[{"text":"Luxury Buyer"},{"text":"Premium brands, exclusivity, customer behaviour"}],[{"text":"E-commerce Buyer"},{"text":"Online assortment, pricing, digital analytics"}],[{"text":"Private Label Buyer"},{"text":"Product development and sourcing"}],[{"text":"International Buyer"},{"text":"Global sourcing and trade"}],[{"text":"Procurement Buyer"},{"text":"Supplier management and purchasing"}],[{"text":"Category Buyer"},{"text":"Full category commercial ownership"}]]}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Best internship targets"},{"type":"p","text":"Apply to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Retail companies"},{"text":"Department stores"},{"text":"Supermarkets"},{"text":"Fashion retailers"},{"text":"E-commerce companies"},{"text":"D2C brands"},{"text":"FMCG companies"},{"text":"Consumer electronics retailers"},{"text":"Lifestyle brands"},{"text":"Procurement organisations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship titles"},{"type":"p","text":"Search for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Buying Intern"},{"text":"Buying Assistant Intern"},{"text":"Merchandising Intern"},{"text":"Retail Operations Intern"},{"text":"Category Management Intern"},{"text":"Procurement Intern"},{"text":"Sourcing Intern"},{"text":"E-commerce Merchandising Intern"},{"text":"Fashion Buying Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Strong Internship Project"},{"type":"h","text":"Retail Category Buying Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Select one category, such as:"},{"type":"h","text":"Sports Shoes"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"h","text":"Product"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Brand"},{"text":"SKU"},{"text":"Size"},{"text":"Colour"},{"text":"Price"},{"text":"Product type"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Sales"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Units sold"},{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Average selling price"},{"text":"Sell-through"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Inventory"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Opening stock"},{"text":"Receipts"},{"text":"Closing stock"},{"text":"Stock cover"},{"text":"Inventory turnover"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Profitability"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Purchase cost"},{"text":"Selling price"},{"text":"Gross margin"},{"text":"Markdown"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Supplier"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Supplier"},{"text":"Lead time"},{"text":"MOQ"},{"text":"Delivery performance"},{"text":"Defect rate"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build the final dashboard using:"},{"type":"h","text":"Excel + Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"Then recommend:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Which products to reorder"},{"text":"Which products to discontinue"},{"text":"Which products need markdown"},{"text":"Which suppliers should receive higher allocations"},{"text":"Which price points perform best"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications and Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Useful areas include:"},{"type"